{
  "title": "Run the judge's checks on a toy workbook",
  "instructions": "This is a **made-up toy workbook**, not a BLUEFIN task. Revenue is an input (100), Cost = 60% of Revenue, and Profit should be Revenue − Cost. The reference answers are Profit = 40 at the base input and 48 after Revenue is perturbed to 120, both with a ±2% tolerance like BLUEFIN's.\n\nPick how the agent built the Profit cell and press **Run judge checks**. Compare the correct formula, the hardcoded number and the sign error, a mistake the paper lists among its recurring ones. Notice that only one build passes both checks, and that the hardcode looks identical to the correct build until the input moves.",
  "html": "<div class=\"bw\"><label for=\"bsel\">How the agent built the Profit cell:</label> <select id=\"bsel\"><option value=\"f\">Formula: =Revenue - Cost</option><option value=\"h\">Hardcoded number: 40</option><option value=\"s\">Sign error: =Revenue + Cost</option></select> <button id=\"brun\" class=\"primary\">Run judge checks</button><table id=\"bsheet\"></table><svg id=\"bsvg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 150\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Expected versus actual profit\"></svg><ol id=\"blog\"></ol></div><style>.bw{font-size:14px;color:var(--fg)}.bw table{border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;width:100%;max-width:460px}.bw td,.bw th{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:4px 8px;text-align:left}.bw th{background:var(--surface)}.bw .pass{color:var(--series-2);font-weight:bold}.bw .fail{color:var(--series-3);font-weight:bold}.bw ol{padding-left:20px}.bw li{margin:3px 0}</style><script>(function(){var RATE=0.6,BASE=100,PERT=120,EXP0=40,EXP1=48;var sel=document.getElementById('bsel'),log=document.getElementById('blog'),sheet=document.getElementById('bsheet'),svg=document.getElementById('bsvg');function profit(b,r){var c=r*RATE;if(b==='f')return r-c;if(b==='h')return 40;return r+c;}function ftext(b){if(b==='f')return '=B1-B2';if(b==='h')return '40 (typed constant)';return '=B1+B2';}function ok(v,t){return Math.abs(v-t)<=Math.abs(t)*0.02;}function li(html){var e=document.createElement('li');e.innerHTML=html;log.appendChild(e);}function tag(p){return p?'<span class=\"pass\">PASS</span>':'<span class=\"fail\">FAIL</span>';}function drawSheet(b,r){sheet.innerHTML='';var rows=[['Cell','Content','Value'],['B1 Revenue','input',String(r)],['B2 Cost','=B1*60%',String(r*RATE)],['B3 Profit',ftext(b),String(profit(b,r))]];rows.forEach(function(row,i){var tr=document.createElement('tr');row.forEach(function(c){var td=document.createElement(i===0?'th':'td');td.textContent=c;tr.appendChild(td);});sheet.appendChild(tr);});}function bars(items){while(svg.firstChild)svg.removeChild(svg.firstChild);var max=0;items.forEach(function(it){if(it.v>max)max=it.v;});var ns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';var w=60,gap=18,x0=14,h=100;items.forEach(function(it,i){var bh=max>0?it.v/max*h:0;var x=x0+i*(w+gap);var r=document.createElementNS(ns,'rect');r.setAttribute('x',x);r.setAttribute('y',115-bh);r.setAttribute('width',w);r.setAttribute('height',bh);r.setAttribute('fill',it.c);svg.appendChild(r);var t=document.createElementNS(ns,'text');t.setAttribute('x',x+w/2);t.setAttribute('y',110-bh);t.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');t.setAttribute('font-size','11');t.setAttribute('fill','var(--fg)');t.textContent=String(it.v);svg.appendChild(t);var l=document.createElementNS(ns,'text');l.setAttribute('x',x+w/2);l.setAttribute('y',132);l.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');l.setAttribute('font-size','10');l.setAttribute('fill','var(--muted)');l.textContent=it.l;svg.appendChild(l);var l2=document.createElementNS(ns,'text');l2.setAttribute('x',x+w/2);l2.setAttribute('y',145);l2.setAttribute('text-anchor','middle');l2.setAttribute('font-size','10');l2.setAttribute('fill','var(--muted)');l2.textContent=it.l2;svg.appendChild(l2);});}function run(){var b=sel.value;log.innerHTML='';var p0=profit(b,BASE);drawSheet(b,BASE);var ov=ok(p0,EXP0);li('Read B3 with Revenue = '+BASE+': value '+p0+'.');li('Output Validation: is '+p0+' within ±2% of '+EXP0+'? '+tag(ov));li('Perturb: set Revenue to '+PERT+', call recalc_workbook.');var p1=profit(b,PERT);li('Read B3 again: value '+p1+'. Expected '+EXP1+' (±2%). Perturbation: '+tag(ok(p1,EXP1)));li('Restore Revenue to '+BASE+' and recalc, leaving the workbook unchanged.');bars([{v:EXP0,l:'Expected',l2:'base',c:'var(--series-1)'},{v:p0,l:'Actual',l2:'base',c:ov?'var(--series-2)':'var(--series-3)'},{v:EXP1,l:'Expected',l2:'perturbed',c:'var(--series-1)'},{v:p1,l:'Actual',l2:'perturbed',c:ok(p1,EXP1)?'var(--series-2)':'var(--series-3)'}]);}document.getElementById('brun').addEventListener('click',run);sel.addEventListener('change',run);run();})();</script>"
}
